{"seq":2,"slug":"annotation-list-declaration-elements-mapping","title":"核注清单的构成、申报要素与和报关单的对应关系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-warehouse-ledger-integration/eledger-annotation-list/annotation-list-declaration-elements-mapping","wordCount":3086,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"核注清单的构成-申报要素与和报关单的对应关系\">核注清单的构成、申报要素与和报关单的对应关系</h1><p>保税仓的系统工程师常把核注清单（业内简称「核注单」）当成另一张报关单来对接，于是第一版接口总是漏掉两样东西：<strong>账册项号</strong>和<strong>法定数量口径</strong>。核注清单不是报关单的副本，它是<strong>账册上的记账凭证</strong>——一票货在海关监管链条上「动了多少、动到哪本底账」，由核注清单回答；而「这批货按什么海关编码、由谁申报、缴不缴税」，由报关单回答。同一批货同时产生这两套数据，靠<strong>项号映射</strong>与<strong>关联单号</strong>互指。把这条映射做错，货物能报关却落不了账，账册的进出存就会在下一轮核销时对不平。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-五个必须先钉死的术语\">核心概念：五个必须先钉死的术语</h2><p>对接核注清单前，先把下面五个概念的边界分清——它们在报文里都只是一个字段，但各自指向监管链条上完全不同的动作。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>易被混淆成什么</th>\n<th>边界判据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>核注清单</strong></td>\n<td>账册的记账凭证，对底账做核增/核减，回答「账上动了多少」</td>\n<td>报关单的副本</td>\n<td>是否改变底账余额：是则为核注清单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>核放单</strong></td>\n<td>卡口放行指令，引用核注清单把已记账货物实放出去</td>\n<td>核注清单的一步</td>\n<td>是否实际过卡口：管放行不管记账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>报关单</strong></td>\n<td>向海关正式申报 HS 编码、价格、税与贸易方式的单据</td>\n<td>核注清单</td>\n<td>是否面向统计与税收、是否产生税单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>账册项号</strong></td>\n<td>电子账册备案商品的账册内序号，核注清单表体必须引用它</td>\n<td>HS 编码</td>\n<td>一本账册内唯一、归并料号后生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>法定数量口径</strong></td>\n<td>按 HS 编码法定计量单位折算的申报数量，区别于成交数量</td>\n<td>成交数量</td>\n<td>表体须同时申报，按单位换算系数折算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三个关系词也需精确：<strong>核增/核减</strong>是底账的记账方向（进境核增、离境核减）；<strong>关联单号</strong>是核注清单与报关单互指的外部键，支撑事后双向对账；<strong>项号映射</strong>则是二者表体行之间 1:1、1:N、N:1 的对应规则。记账、放行、征税三件事由三类单据分别承担，这是理解本篇其余结构的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核注清单在监管链条中的位置-它是账册的借方-贷方凭证\">核注清单在监管链条中的位置：它是账册的借方/贷方凭证</h2><p>金关二期体系下，保税货物的一次实际流动会同时或先后产生三类数据，职责严格分离：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>是否记账</th>\n<th>是否放行</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>核注清单</strong></td>\n<td>这批货在账册上增减多少</td>\n<td>是（核增/核减底账）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>核放单</strong></td>\n<td>这批货能否过卡口</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是（凭核放单过卡口）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>报关单</strong></td>\n<td>这批货向海关正式申报什么</td>\n<td>否（除少数情形）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者关系是<strong>账册为核心、核注清单为记账动作</strong>：货进境入仓，先有核注清单在进口底账核增；货出区离境，核注清单在对应底账核减；核放单只是把已经核注的货物实放出去，它引用核注清单编号，本身不改变账册余额。因此核注清单的构成直接决定了账册能不能对平——这也是它与报关单最本质的区别：<strong>报关单面向海关统计与税收，核注清单面向账册数量的守恒</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  E[&quot;电子账册&lt;br/&gt;账册编号 + 备案项号&quot;] --&gt; N[&quot;核注清单&lt;br/&gt;表头 + 表体&quot;]&#10;  N --&gt;|核增| L1[&quot;进口/库存底账&quot;]&#10;  N --&gt;|核减| L2[&quot;出口/结转底账&quot;]&#10;  N --&gt;|关联| D[&quot;报关单&lt;br/&gt;项号 + HS + 税&quot;]&#10;  N --&gt;|引用| R[&quot;核放单&lt;br/&gt;卡口实放&quot;]&#10;  D -.同一批货物.-&gt; R&#10;  L1 --&gt; X[&quot;账册余量守恒&lt;br/&gt;核销时平衡校验&quot;]&#10;  L2 --&gt; X\">graph TD\n  E[\"电子账册&lt;br/&gt;账册编号 + 备案项号\"] --&gt; N[\"核注清单&lt;br/&gt;表头 + 表体\"]\n  N --&gt;|核增| L1[\"进口/库存底账\"]\n  N --&gt;|核减| L2[\"出口/结转底账\"]\n  N --&gt;|关联| D[\"报关单&lt;br/&gt;项号 + HS + 税\"]\n  N --&gt;|引用| R[\"核放单&lt;br/&gt;卡口实放\"]\n  D -.同一批货物.-&gt; R\n  L1 --&gt; X[\"账册余量守恒&lt;br/&gt;核销时平衡校验\"]\n  L2 --&gt; X</pre><h2 id=\"表头-一票核注清单的身份-方向与约束\">表头：一票核注清单的身份、方向与约束</h2><p>表头是一票核注清单的「主键与语境」，对接时最不能丢的是<strong>方向标志</strong>与<strong>账册编号</strong>。核心字段分组如下（字段命名以中国国际贸易单一窗口申报界面为准，<a href=\"https://www.singlewindow.cn/\">singlewindow.cn</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分组</th>\n<th>关键字段</th>\n<th>工程意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>身份</td>\n<td>核注清单编号、申报日期、申报单位</td>\n<td>单据唯一键，重放/幂等必须以此为锚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账册</td>\n<td><strong>账册编号</strong>、企业海关编码、经营单位</td>\n<td>决定这笔增减落到哪本账册；错则整票无效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方向</td>\n<td><strong>进出口标志</strong>、监管方式、清单类型</td>\n<td>进=核增、出=核减；监管方式须与账册备案一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关联</td>\n<td><strong>关联报关单编号</strong>、核放单编号、合同号</td>\n<td>与报关单/核放单建立可追溯的引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>进出境日期、申报期限标识</td>\n<td>影响核销周期的归属</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>方向标志与账册备案的监管方式必须相容。</strong> 保税仓库货物（1233）与跨境电商网购保税进口（1210/1239，见海关总署公告 2018 年第 194 号）走的准入规则不同，一票标成出口标志的核注清单若引用了只备案了进口方向的底账，系统会在核注环节直接退单——这类错误在对接日志里表现为「账册项号不存在」，实际根因却在表头方向。另一个易被忽略的点是<strong>监管方式一致性</strong>：核注清单表头的监管方式必须与账册头备案的监管方式匹配（见同章 <a href=\"e-ledger-hierarchy-and-item-filing\">电子账册结构模型</a> 对账册头的分析），否则记账会落到一本与货物实际监管身份不符的账册上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"表体-项号-数量口径与规范申报要素\">表体：项号、数量口径与规范申报要素</h2><p>表体是核注清单真正承载数量的地方，一行即一个<strong>账册项号</strong>。它的字段分为三类，每一类都在对接中出过经典故障：</p>\n<p><strong>第一类——引用键：账册项号。</strong> 表体的 <code>项号</code> 指向账册里备案商品的项号，而非企业内部料号。企业 WMS 里的 SKU 要经<strong>归并映射</strong>才落到项号上，且一条项号往往对应多条料号：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>法定</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q^{\\text{法定}}_{i} = \\sum_{s \\in \\pi^{-1}(i)} q_s \\cdot r_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">法定</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7463em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi^{-1}(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是归并到账册项号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的全部企业料号集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是料号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 到法定单位的换算系数。这条公式解释了一个高频故障：<strong>核注清单上的数量是法定数量，而对接方往往只拿到内部成交数量</strong>，若换算系数与料号一起做了版本管理，历史核注才能复算（映射表的版本化设计见同章 <a href=\"e-ledger-hierarchy-and-item-filing\">电子账册结构模型</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>第二类——计量口径：成交数量/单位、法定数量/单位、第二数量/单位。</strong> 核注清单要求同时申报成交口径与法定口径。法定数量是账册记账与核销比对的<strong>唯一权威口径</strong>；成交数量仅供价格统计。两者不可混用——把成交数量当法定数量核注，短期看不出问题，核销时会出现「有耗用的料件法定数量对不上」。</p>\n<p><strong>第三类——商品属性与规范申报要素。</strong> 表体除商品编号（HS）、商品名称、规格型号、原产国、最终目的国、境内货源地、币制、单价、总价外，还承载<strong>规范申报要素</strong>。规范申报要素由海关总署按 HS 章逐条制定并要求进口/出口申报时填报（例如塑料及其制品须申报成分含量、单体单元种类及比例、外观；机电产品须申报用途、品牌、型号）。核注清单的规格型号字段应作为申报要素的结构化载体，只填内部物料名的做法在核放或查验时会因「申报要素不全」被退单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核注清单与报关单-一对多-多对一的项号映射\">核注清单与报关单：一对多、多对一的项号映射</h2><p>两者的关系不是复制，而是<strong>两套口径之间的映射</strong>。记核注清单表体项号集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{M}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">M</span></span></span></span></span>、报关单表体项号集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，则二者通过一个非平凡关系 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f \\subseteq \\mathcal{M} \\times \\mathcal{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 相连，常见三种形态：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>基数</th>\n<th>对接后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 : 1</td>\n<td>一票核注、一票报关，项号一一对应</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"script\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vert\\mathcal{M}\\vert=\\vert\\mathcal{R}\\vert</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最简单，直接用关联单号互指</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 : N</td>\n<td><strong>分批核注</strong>：一次报关、货物分批进出卡口逐批核注</td>\n<td>一报关单 ↔ 多核注清单</td>\n<td>报关单项号需累计多票核注数量，方能与总申报量平衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>N : 1</td>\n<td><strong>合并报关</strong>：多票核注合并为一票报关申报</td>\n<td>多核注清单 ↔ 一报关单</td>\n<td>核注项号被拆分/合并，须显式维护项号映射表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>核心对应键有两个：表头的「关联报关单编号」，以及表体的「项号映射」。</strong> 前者解决「这票核注属于哪张报关单」，后者解决「这张报关单的哪个商品项由这票核注的哪个项号支撑」。只有表头关联而缺项号映射，就会出现「整票对得上、单项对不上」——核销时逐项比对必然暴露。</p>\n<p>工程上应把两套数量的守恒写成硬校验。设账册项号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 在某核销周期内的报关申报总量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、核注净增总量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则对全部已申报项号要求：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>⟺</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>报关口径与账册口径在本周期内闭合</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i} D_i \\;=\\; \\sum_{i} N_i \\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad \\text{报关口径与账册口径在本周期内闭合}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">报关口径与账册口径在本周期内闭合</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一旦 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_i \\ne N_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 且无法解释为在途、退运或跨周期，就是核销差异的种子——这也是把核注清单与报关单做<strong>双向对账</strong>而非单向推送的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对接实现-报文-幂等与差错重放\">对接实现：报文、幂等与差错重放</h2><p>核注清单走海关联网申报报文通道（金关二期数据交换体系），对接实现有几处必须做对的硬约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>以核注清单编号做幂等键</strong>。海关返回的核注回执可能因网络原因重发，重复核注会导致账册重复核增。请求侧应携带本地唯一流水号，回执侧以核注清单编号去重，二者建立映射表。</li>\n<li><strong>状态机必须显式</strong>。一票核注清单有「已申报 → 已核注/已退单」的状态迁移；只有收到核注成功回执才算记账完成，仅收到「接收成功」不代表已核注。把「接收」当「核注」是账册凭空多货的经典根因。</li>\n<li><strong>失败要能定向重放</strong>。退单原因（账册项号不存在、数量超余额、监管方式不符、申报要素不全）应解析成结构化错误码，重放单元是<strong>单票核注清单</strong>，绝不整批重推——整批重推会把已成功的票二次核注。</li>\n<li><strong>余额校验前置到发送前</strong>。核减类核注在发送前应本地校验账册项号可用余量，超余额的请求不发出去，比等海关退单再重试更快也更干净。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些约束与 WMS 侧的账册实时对接共用同一套差错处理骨架，具体见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../wms-customs-integration/\">WMS 与海关系统对接</a>；核销周期结束时这些差异项如何处置，见 <a href=\"../bonded-stocktake-writeoff/\">保税仓盘点与核销</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>核注清单是<strong>账册的记账凭证</strong>，不是报关单副本：它核增/核减底账余额，报关单负责海关统计与税收，核放单负责卡口实放。</li>\n<li><strong>表头决定这票货落到哪本账册</strong>：账册编号、进出口方向标志、监管方式三者必须与账册备案相容，任一不符即整票无效。</li>\n<li><strong>表体以账册项号为引用键</strong>，数量一律以<strong>法定数量</strong>为记账与核销口径，成交数量仅供价格统计，两者不可混用。</li>\n<li><strong>规范申报要素是表体的一部分</strong>，由海关总署按 HS 章制定；只填内部物料名会在核放或查验时被退单。</li>\n<li>核注清单与报关单通过**「关联报关单编号」+ 项号映射**相连，存在 1:1 / 1:N（分批核注）/ N:1（合并报关）三种形态，须以双向对账保证两套数量在本周期内闭合。</li>\n<li>对接实现的四个硬约束：<strong>核注清单编号做幂等键、状态机区分「接收」与「核注」、退单按单票定向重放、余量校验前置</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"核注清单的构成、申报要素与和报关单的对应关系","id":"核注清单的构成-申报要素与和报关单的对应关系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：五个必须先钉死的术语","id":"核心概念-五个必须先钉死的术语"},{"level":2,"text":"核注清单在监管链条中的位置：它是账册的借方/贷方凭证","id":"核注清单在监管链条中的位置-它是账册的借方-贷方凭证"},{"level":2,"text":"表头：一票核注清单的身份、方向与约束","id":"表头-一票核注清单的身份-方向与约束"},{"level":2,"text":"表体：项号、数量口径与规范申报要素","id":"表体-项号-数量口径与规范申报要素"},{"level":2,"text":"核注清单与报关单：一对多、多对一的项号映射","id":"核注清单与报关单-一对多-多对一的项号映射"},{"level":2,"text":"对接实现：报文、幂等与差错重放","id":"对接实现-报文-幂等与差错重放"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"电子账册结构模型：账册头、底账、备案商品与料号层级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-warehouse-ledger-integration/eledger-annotation-list/e-ledger-hierarchy-and-item-filing"},"next":{"title":"账册备案变更、账册归并与超期/溢短的异常处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-warehouse-ledger-integration/eledger-annotation-list/ledger-change-consolidation-and-exception"}}